<speak>That distinction matters to me. I am not looking for a shortened document that replaces everything else. I want a reliable route back to the full material. At the office, an informal summary can sometimes take on a life of its own. Somebody forwards it, another person removes the original attachment, and eventually people are quoting a sentence without knowing what it referred to. I would prefer not to create that problem in my personal records. A short covering note with a clear pointer is enough.</speak>